{"steam_appid":584400,"steam_name":"Sonic Mania","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/584400/119472/7b5d3da09a239bbeb2af4e81e156c5faa06de8d2/1750556235/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1504024132","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256693465/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1504024132","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584400/ss_27efb8f61892a9bd732952c76dae9dd7ad1b6748.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785856230","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584400/ss_93ee106db863c16e00989ad9d51bcbea4af91ab0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785856230","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584400/ss_72b7374ba1d4978c2b5e7c74c2e56aecc33b0d3c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785856230","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584400/ss_5168ae3cd4e0ccac9808325242ccb2e6760ee2f0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785856230","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584400/ss_1e19c5bd7aaada51a7811f8468f5fb71cf42f3f7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785856230"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the ultimate celebration of past and future in Sonic Mania, an all-new 2D Sonic adventure running at a crisp 60FPS with stunning HD retro-style graphics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple playable characters give you the ability to go explosively fast as Sonic, soar as Tails, or power through tough obstacles with Knuckles’ brute strength.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584400/extras/fdbe565b414d7a414f7ef794838d0f9e.poster.avif?t=1785856230\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584400/extras/fdbe565b414d7a414f7ef794838d0f9e.webm?t=1785856230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584400/extras/fdbe565b414d7a414f7ef794838d0f9e.mp4?t=1785856230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Re-live the Sonic of the past with an exciting new twist on classic zones while fighting against new bosses and Dr. Eggman’s evil robot army.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584400/extras/ccb2ddcce129b21f462b7f53c11e0691.poster.avif?t=1785856230\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584400/extras/ccb2ddcce129b21f462b7f53c11e0691.webm?t=1785856230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584400/extras/ccb2ddcce129b21f462b7f53c11e0691.mp4?t=1785856230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head to-head with players in Competition Mode or play in Co-Op Mode with a friend.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584400/extras/da0fdd12da0d24e4b40736f093a9f68b.poster.avif?t=1785856230\" width=1170 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584400/extras/da0fdd12da0d24e4b40736f093a9f68b.webm?t=1785856230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/584400/extras/da0fdd12da0d24e4b40736f093a9f68b.mp4?t=1785856230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 / 8 / 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 9.0c compliant video card 256MB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><